# Per-run test artefacts (CSVs, log dumps, pprof snapshots). Every test
# scenario writes into its own tests/<kind>/_results/ — perf, soak, and
# anything we add later — and the runner scripts mkdir -p the directory
# themselves, so we don't need to keep the empty parent in version control.
tests/*/_results/
